WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.120
I have to see him.
I'll do whatever it takes!

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.080
Come on in.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.480
We have a newcomer, you guys.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:16.800
I...

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.800
So... this is Cat Island?

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.960
And everyone in this bar used to be human?

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.120
That's right.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.000
You want to be a cat too?

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.480
You must have had an awful time
as a human being!

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.080
Humans are horrible, aren't they?

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.440
Well, that's a little extreme.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.520
-Hey, you.
-Yes?

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.480
If you want to go back to being a human,

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.480
you should leave as soon as possible.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.520
But I can't talk to humans as a cat.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.920
I need to tell someone how I really feel.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.360
-So...
-Why are you still here then?

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:03.200
Once the Mask Seller takes your lifespan,
you'll be stuck here forever.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.360
You won't be able to go back
to being a human.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.840
That... would be a problem.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.520
I have a question.
Don't you regret turning into a cat?

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.240
I do, but what's the point
of dwelling on it?

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.880
It just makes it more depressing.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.560
We ran away.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.560
All of us here chose to run
from our problems.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:22.920
That's right.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:23.960
Take me, for example.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:28.120
I ran from my responsibilities
as a mother.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.280
I was having doubts. Was I giving
my children the love they deserved?

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.480
I began to feel like they knew
I wasn't up to the task.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:39.320
So I ran away.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:45.320
Me too.
I didn't know how to love or be loved.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:49.880
My insecurities suffocated me,
and I had to escape.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.760
We've come to terms with our decisions.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.040
But you still have your life ahead of you.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.400
Tell your special someone
how you really feel.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:58.800
I know you can do it!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.280
-Thanks!
-Too bad, so sad!

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.200
What?

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.200
Hinode isn't in the human realm.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.440
-What?
-I locked him in my shop.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.360
What? You did that to Hinode? Why?

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.840
He came here to look for you.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.280
What? You're lying.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:28.160
Hinode doesn't even know I'm Taro.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:31.760
The cat that has your face...
Kinako, was it?

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:34.400
She was with him,
so he probably heard from her.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.800
Kinako was with him?

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.360
Yes, siree!

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.520
Why couldn't they wait a little longer?

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.240
You'll turn into a real cat soon enough.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:49.880
Hinode was looking for me? Why?

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.480
We must not let them derail our plans.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:57.400
Let's hurry and get going
to the Promised Place now.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.160
Stop it.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.320
She's still a kid.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:11.400
Children have longer lifespans.
Much longer than you!

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.040
I want her lifespan!

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.360
We have to save this Hinode.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.880
Let's go to his shop.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.520
Yes. Thank you. All of you!

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.360
-Hurry!
-Okay!

